  << /ActualText (Carlos Andr\351s is a UX\057UI Designer and Accessibility expert working across Financial\054 Health\054 Insurance\054 Retail\054 Biotechnology\054 Education\054 and IT industries\054 where he crafts inclusive\054 user\055centric\054 and enterprise\055grade digital products\056 His core strength lies in being a comprehensive problem\055solver who leverages solid end\055to\055end knowledge\054 from user research\054 usability tests\054 and collaborative workshops to technical front\055end understanding\056 An adaptable and flexible communicator\054 Carlos Andr\351s thrives in Agile environments by bridging the gap between UX and Engineering\054 scaling robust design systems\054 and ensuring rigorous WCAG compliance across digital ecosystems\056)
